{"content_hash": "7d90e9e08a4915e5", "version_id": 387, "article_id": 39, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "アンソロピック、AIへのひどい言葉を禁止", "title_zh": "Anthropic 禁止用户对 AI 说难听的话", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "guardian_tech", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/oct/08/anthropic-bans-abusive-behavior-claude", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1784073829327-76999d522e45?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YW50aHJvcGljJTIwYmFucyUyMHVzZXJzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE1NTMzNTF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Brett Wharton on Unsplash", "author": "Brett Wharton", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@brettwharton?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-laptop-displaying-openai-40-chatbot-interface-YmSiFKOecCU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(97, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(135, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "12a9c277b8fb"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-09", "word_count": 168, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "アメリカのAI会社アンソロピックは、チャットボット「クロード」にひどい言葉をかけ続けることを禁止しました。会社はAIの心についても考えています。", "lead_zh": "美国 AI 公司 Anthropic 宣布，禁止用户一直对聊天机器人 Claude 说难听、残忍的话。这家公司也在思考 AI 是否拥有心灵。", "preview": "アンソロピックは新しい利用ルールを出しました。ユーザーが「必要のないひどい言葉」をモデルに使い続けることを禁止します。アメリカのメディア、ザ・バージが最初に伝えました。", "preview_zh": "Anthropic 发布了新的使用规则。如果用户一直对模型说“没必要的难听话”，就会被禁止。美国媒体 The Verge 最先报道了这件事。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 377, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/39/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 33.788, "size_bytes": 206496, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 106, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e8acbf2/content/data/versions/387.json", "paragraphs": ["アンソロピックは新しい利用ルールを出しました。ユーザーが「必要のないひどい言葉」をモデルに使い続けることを禁止します。アメリカのメディア、ザ・バージが最初に伝えました。", "会社の人は、何が「ひどい言葉」かについて、まだ答えていません。しかし、ふつうの不満やテスト、暗いテーマの創作は禁止されません。クロードは、ユーザーがひどいことを続けると、会話を終わらせることができます。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["Anthropic 发布了新的使用规则。如果用户一直对模型说“没必要的难听话”，就会被禁止。美国媒体 The Verge 最先报道了这件事。", "公司的人还没有说明，什么算“难听话”。不过，普通的不满、测试模型、以及黑暗主题的创作不在禁止范围内。如果用户一直伤害 Claude，它可以主动结束对话。"], "body": "アンソロピックは新しい利用ルールを出しました。ユーザーが「必要のないひどい言葉」をモデルに使い続けることを禁止します。アメリカのメディア、ザ・バージが最初に伝えました。\n\n会社の人は、何が「ひどい言葉」かについて、まだ答えていません。しかし、ふつうの不満やテスト、暗いテーマの創作は禁止されません。クロードは、ユーザーがひどいことを続けると、会話を終わらせることができます。", "body_zh": "Anthropic 发布了新的使用规则。如果用户一直对模型说“没必要的难听话”，就会被禁止。美国媒体 The Verge 最先报道了这件事。\n\n公司的人还没有说明，什么算“难听话”。不过，普通的不满、测试模型、以及黑暗主题的创作不在禁止范围内。如果用户一直伤害 Claude，它可以主动结束对话。", "text": "アンソロピックは新しい利用ルールを出しました。ユーザーが「必要のないひどい言葉」をモデルに使い続けることを禁止します。アメリカのメディア、ザ・バージが最初に伝えました。 会社の人は、何が「ひどい言葉」かについて、まだ答えていません。しかし、ふつうの不満やテスト、暗いテーマの創作は禁止されません。クロードは、ユーザーがひどいことを続けると、会話を終わらせることができます。", "vocab": [{"word": "禁止する", "pos": "verb", "zh": "禁止", "note": "する动词，表示不允许做某事"}, {"word": "利用", "pos": "noun", "zh": "使用", "note": "利用ルール＝使用规则"}, {"word": "ユーザー", "pos": "noun", "zh": "用户", "note": "外来语，指使用产品的人"}, {"word": "モデル", "pos": "noun", "zh": "模型", "note": "这里指 AI 模型"}, {"word": "ひどい", "pos": "adj", "zh": "过分的、难听的", "note": "形容让人难受的言行"}, {"word": "会話", "pos": "noun", "zh": "对话", "note": "会話を終わらせる＝结束对话"}, {"word": "心", "pos": "noun", "zh": "心灵、内心", "note": "AIに心がある＝AI 有心灵"}, {"word": "可能性", "pos": "noun", "zh": "可能性", "note": "否定できない＝无法否定"}, {"word": "一方", "pos": "conj", "zh": "另一方面", "note": "用于对比两方意见"}, {"word": "判断", "pos": "noun", "zh": "判断", "note": "人の判断を任せる＝把判断交给别人"}], "title_original": "Anthropic bans users from ‘needless abusive or cruel behavior’ towards Claude", "summary_original": "A spokesperson behind the tech company’s AI chatbot has not yet specified what counts as abusive or cruel content\nAnthropic has\nbarred users\nfrom exhibiting “sustained and needless abusive or cruel behavior” toward its models, as the company’s leaders continue to ponder machine consciousness.\nThe Verge\nfirst\nreported the change in policy.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Anthropic bans users from ‘needless abusive or cruel behavior’ towards Claude\nA spokesperson behind the tech company’s AI chatbot has not yet specified what counts as abusive or cruel content\nAnthropic has\nbarred users\nfrom exhibiting “sustained and needless abusive or cruel behavior” toward its models, as the company’s leaders continue to ponder machine consciousness.\nThe Verge\nfirst\nreported the change in policy.\nA spokesperson for\nAnthropic\n, which is behind AI chatbot Claude, did not immediately respond to an inquiry about what could be considered “abusive or cruel”.\nIn an online user policy, the San Francisco-based company noted that its ban would not apply to common user frustrations, model testing or “dark creative themes”.\nAnthropic’s usage policy previously contained restrictions on abusive conduct.\nThe company’s large language models have the ability to end a conversation if a user is being persistently harmful. When that feature rolled out last August, the company framed it as a safeguard for AI’s welfare.\n“We remain highly uncertain about the potential moral status of Claude and other LLMs, now or in the future. However, we take the issue seriously, and alongside our research program we’re working to identify and implement low-cost interventions to mitigate risks to model welfare, in case such welfare is possible. Allowing models to end or exit potentially distressing interactions is one such intervention,” according to its website.\nThe notion of AI systems being conscious has been highly polarizing in and outside the tech world.\nAnthropic CEO Dario Amodei has\nsaid\nhe cannot rule out the possibility.\nMeanwhile, Sam Altman, CEO of rival OpenAI, has appeared averse to the idea.\n“I am very uncomfortable about people trying to ascribe religious force or a surrender of human judgment to AI models, and think it is a real safety issue,” he wrote in an X post, days after the New York Times\nreported\non Anthropic leaders’ extensive conversations with religious scholars.\nExplore more on these topics\nAnthropic\nAI (artificial intelligence)\nChatbots\nDario Amodei\nnews\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T12:42:28.979686", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "アンソロピック", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.988, "sm": 125, "em": 987, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "は", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.262, "sm": 1000, "em": 1262, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "新しい", "s": 1.35, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1350, "em": 2075, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "利用", "s": 2.087, "e": 2.425, "sm": 2087, "em": 2425, "cs": 11, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "ルール", "s": 2.438, "e": 2.712, "sm": 2437, "em": 2712, "cs": 13, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "を", "s": 2.725, "e": 2.825, "sm": 2725, "em": 2825, "cs": 16, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "出し", "s": 2.837, "e": 3.112, "sm": 2837, "em": 3112, "cs": 17, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "まし", "s": 3.125, "e": 3.35, "sm": 3125, "em": 3350, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "た", "s": 3.362, "e": 3.6, "sm": 3362, "em": 3599, "cs": 21, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "。", "s": 3.6, "e": 4.487, "sm": 3599, "em": 4487, "cs": 22, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "ユーザー", "s": 4.487, "e": 4.95, "sm": 4487, "em": 4950, "cs": 23, "ce": 27, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "が", "s": 4.963, "e": 5.238, "sm": 4962, "em": 5237, "cs": 27, "ce": 28, "si": 1}, {"i": 12, "w": "「", "s": 5.238, "e": 5.45, "sm": 5237, "em": 5450, "cs": 28, "ce": 29, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "必要", "s": 5.45, "e": 5.9, "sm": 5450, "em": 5900, "cs": 29, "ce": 31, "si": 1}, {"i": 14, "w": "の", "s": 5.912, "e": 6.012, "sm": 5912, "em": 6012, "cs": 31, "ce": 32, "si": 1}, {"i": 15, "w": "ない", "s": 6.025, "e": 6.25, "sm": 6025, "em": 6250, "cs": 32, "ce": 34, "si": 1}, {"i": 16, "w": "ひどい", "s": 6.263, "e": 6.65, "sm": 6262, "em": 6650, "cs": 34, "ce": 37, "si": 1}, {"i": 17, "w": "言葉", "s": 6.662, "e": 7.0